  "description": "Go fast, go long. Designed to ride further, faster, and with less effort, the Roadmachine 01 AMP continues the Roadmachine legacy with advanced e-road innovation. Powered by the light and silent TQ-HPR60 newest drive unit, fully integrated into our Premium Carbon frame, it delivers silent, smooth, natural assistance without compromising on ride feel. Our Roadmachine 01 geometry will position you in a slightly more upright position to keep you fresh while pushing the pedals on your longest rides. Outfitted with SHIMANO 105 Di2 1x shifting, Praxis cranks, AR 27 alloy wheels, and the ICS cable integrated RSM01 stem, it’s the perfect companion for riders chasing real-world endurance with extra support.",
